    <Comments>CICT-PLM-GT-070 | Tirukkural Adhikaram 70 (மன்னரைச் சேர்ந்தொழுதல் / Conduct in the Presence of the King) | kurals 691-700 | section பொருள் / subsection அமைச்சியல் | DOI 10.5281/zenodo.20715639 | record https://zenodo.org/records/20715639 | manuscriptId 19587_72 | NOTE: line Coords are band-derived full-width bounding boxes (approximate); transcription text is exact ground truth.</Comments>
